{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord for exclusive access to our closed alpha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.poster.avif?t=1768838871\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.webm?t=1768838871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard <strong>Uh Oh Airlines</strong>: the delightfully unhinged single player or couch co-op flight attendant simulator where the skies are friendly, the passengers are feral, and disaster is always cruising at 30,000 feet. Play solo or team up with a friend as you juggle spilled sodas, mysterious smells, and passenger meltdowns, while trying to keep everyone (including yourself) from spiraling into full airborne anarchy.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1768838871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras_big/7b61287f1047b504b7ab6a9a35b3c7b8.avif?t=1768838871 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.poster.avif?t=1768838871\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/afb772929d6f96917f39325e2e76a2b1.webm?t=1768838871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve drinks and soothe panicked flyers while pretending you aren\u2019t <i>also</i> mildly panicked. Wrestle open overhead bins that seem to defy the laws of physics, dodge projectile dogs and cats, and clean up mystery liquids. Was it soda? Something worse? Don't ask us! Try not to think too hard about that while still thinking on your feet, because in this full-throttle frenzy, every second counts, and the seatbelt sign is basically just a suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/58e830edb4a5dcf82f41eedf9afda1b6.avif?t=1768838871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras_big/58e830edb4a5dcf82f41eedf9afda1b6.avif?t=1768838871 width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.poster.avif?t=1768838871\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/08b670b0bea48cfe66df3544cc9749ad.webm?t=1768838871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catastrophes are coming in hot, sometimes literally. You could rise to the occasion and douse the flames (both metaphorical and real)\u2026 or just let it all burn in glorious chaos. But, uh, maybe grab the fire extinguisher. Just a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re flying solo or teaming up with a friend, one thing\u2019s for sure: things are about to get bumpy. Tray tables up and buckle up. This is your captain speaking: <strong><i>good luck.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582430?t=1768838871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/ed41dc589af52e028c8e0a323d229ad06dfce44c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768838871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/67b3de23b5c69201db4ce9a1a013cc2eab5bdde1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768838871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/67b3de23b5c69201db4ce9a1a013cc2eab5bdde1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768838871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3582760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord for exclusive access to our closed alpha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.poster.avif?t=1768838871\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/72f3e19f9d64da35036307f53ed56eab.webm?t=1768838871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard <strong>Uh Oh Airlines</strong>: the delightfully unhinged single player or couch co-op flight attendant simulator where the skies ar